&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;
&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;12）&lt;/span&gt;前各号に付帯関連する一切の業務&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;（新 設）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
